{"title": "Gushing Air", "pageid": 22589, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gushing_Air", "categories": ["Class actions", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Thunder damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gushing_Air.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Gushing_Air.webp/300px-Gushing_Air.webp, /w/images/5/5a/Gushing_Air.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Gushing_Air.webp/300px-Gushing_Air.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Gushing_Air.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Gushing Air</b> is an action unique to the <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Elemental\" title=\"Air Elemental\">Air Elemental</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nLaunch 2 jets of thunderous, billowing air.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">A